            "speakerName": "安顺",
            "text": "按照惯例，应该是玉衡星刻晴大人监工，不过刻晴大人最近似乎在忙别的事情…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1100904",
      "subQuestName": "(test)【废弃】前往说书人处商议计划",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "110090401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "110090401": {
            "id": "110090401",
            "speakerId": 10234,
            "speakerName": "白术",
            "text": "凝光小姐需要的伤药，未免有点太多了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110090402"
            ]
          },
          "110090402": {
            "id": "110090402",
            "speakerId": 10234,
            "speakerName": "白术",
            "text": "重修群玉阁原来是这么危险的事情吗？奇怪…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1100908",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "110090801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "110090801": {
            "id": "110090801",
            "speakerId": 12371,
            "speakerName": "理正",
            "text": "嘘…别吵，没看见我在忙吗？每一块砖都很关键，万一砌歪了可就糟了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1100909",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "110090901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "110090901": {
            "id": "110090901",
            "speakerId": 12372,
            "speakerName": "思勤",
            "text": "在下奉命保卫这里的安全，工期要紧，希望别出什么岔子。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1100910",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "110091001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "110091001": {
            "id": "110091001",
            "speakerId": 12348,
            "speakerName": "阿亮",
            "text": "最近千岩军调动频繁，也不知道发生了什么事…还是小心为好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1100911",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "110091101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "110091101": {
            "id": "110091101",
            "speakerId": 10334,
            "speakerName": "百闻",
            "text": "兹事体大，我得对得起凝光大人的信任…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110091102"
            ]
          },
          "110091102": {
            "id": "110091102",
            "speakerId": 10334,
            "speakerName": "百闻",
            "text": "嗯？你们是来交材料的吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1100999",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "110099901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "110099901": {
            "id": "110099901",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}，你听见了吗？那些人好像有情报欸！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110099902"
            ]
          },
          "110099902": {
            "id": "110099902",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "我们现在最需要的就是情报了，快跟上去看看吧！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110099903"
            ]
          },
          "110099903": {
            "id": "110099903",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "咦…好像不在这里，我们往下面找找看吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110099904"
            ]
          },
          "110099904": {
            "id": "110099904",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#嘘…{NICKNAME}，你说申鹤她会不会是仙人呀？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110099905"
            ]
          },
          "110099905": {
            "id": "110099905",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "她好像是第一次来璃月港，也缺乏很多该有的常识，如果是仙人的话，就能解释得通了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110099906"
            ]
          },
          "110099906": {
            "id": "110099906",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "到底是哪一位仙人呢？真让人好奇…"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}